uploads_result.json
# plays/*/data/script.pdf is deliberately absent: derived but COMMITTED, because its
# rebuild costs 45 s of LaTeX, so uploads.yml typesets it on promotion only. Counterpart:
# a script.json edited by hand in the repo keeps a stale PDF (cf. build_script_pdf.py).
# Nothing else of the PDF is ignored: `build_script_pdf.py` typesets into a temporary
# DIRECTORY and copies the result in, so no half-written file is ever left in the folder
# the Action commits whole (a `script.pdf.part` rule sat here guarding a name no code
# has ever written).
# A play's pages are generated from pages/ at every config load (vite.config.js): derived
# and free to rebuild, unlike the PDF above.
plays/*/*.html
